	(text "PER-SLOT SMART CHARGER CHANNEL (x8 INSTANCES: SLOTS 1-8)\n- Charger IC: TI BQ25188YBGR (I2C addr 0x6A via TCA9548A mux)\n- Programmable VBAT: 3.60V - 4.65V in 10mV steps (4.20V LiPo / 4.35V LiHV / 3.80V Storage)\n- Programmable ICHG: 5mA - 1000mA in 10mA steps (150mA for 150mAh 1C, 500mA for 500mAh 1C)\n- Dual Parallel Connectors: Molex PicoBlade 1.25mm (Ultra Micro) + BetaFPV BT2.0"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
